Without Lambda
interface Hello {

    void sayHello();
}

class Demo implements Hello {

    public void sayHello() {

        System.out.println("Hello Java");
    }
}

public class Main {

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        Hello h = new Demo();

        h.sayHello();
    }
}

With Lambda Expression
Lambda Expression एक ऐसा Anonymous Function है जो Functional Interface के Method को कम Code में Implement करता है।
interface Hello {

    void sayHello();
}

public class Main {

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        Hello h = () -> System.out.println("Hello Java");

        h.sayHello();
    }
}
